 <h3><u>Jab maula mehdi aaenge</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p dir=ltr>Maula Maula..(2)</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>ya mahdi..(20)</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>jab noor ka suraj chamkega<br> karwat yeh zamana badlega<br> sab chand sitare mehdi ki chaukhat ke diye ban jaaega&nbsp;<br> dekhega zamane yeh manzar dar baite ali ka khultey hi<br> deewaare haram ke sab patthar haider haider dohraaengey</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>jab maula mehdi aaengey<br> jo gaasibey haqqe zahra hai..(2)<br> qabro se uthaae jaaengey</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>kaabe ko sajaya jaaega badlega zamane ka manzar<br> tayyariye jashne eide ghadeer is tarah karengey woh aakar<br> jannat ke purane darzi se<br> malboos naye silwaaengey</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>kuch ibne adam aisey hai adam ke amal par hai barham<br> masjid ke aagey hotey hue jo dekh nahi saktey hotey matam<br> jab matam hoga kaabe me&nbsp;<br> woh jal jal ke mar jaaegey</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>qaem ki adalat me ek din woh pesh sabhi mujrim hogey<br> har daur me mimbar par chadke jo bughze ali mei boltey the<br> hai mujhko yakeen maula unki<br> meesam se zabaa khichwaaengey</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>nasir abbas taqi hadi sibte jafar mohsin naqvi<br> tehzeeb wajahat asif ho yaa aun sa matamdaar koi<br> jab hogi baqiyya mei majlis&nbsp;<br> yeh saare hume miljaaegey</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>dekhega jahaan yun ahle aza ka rutba badhaya jaega<br> khatune qayamat ka rauza jab firse banaya jaaega<br> chun chun kar matami halko se&nbsp;<br> mazdoor bulaae jaaengey</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>kya hoga qayamat ka manzar&nbsp;<br> kuffar ki dunya larzegi<br> baalo ko chudaate khaak ko jab utthengey lahad se maula ali<br> fir fauj me apne bete ki&nbsp;<br> woh khud shamil ho jaaegey</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>haider ki wilayat ka dushman tauheed ka dushman hota hai<br> tauheed ke waris hai mehdi tab bhi mera dil yeh kehta hai<br> dushman hai wilaayat ke jitney<br> woh pehle maare jaaengey</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>kuch bhi toh nahi hai tayyari hoto pe zabani yeh daawa hai<br> aa jaae agar woh milne ko kya koi aisa gosha hai<br> jhaako toh makaamo me apne<br> hum unko kaha tehraaengey</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>wallah khadi reh jaaegi har nasle umayya ki saazish<br> kya jandullah kya ainusra alqaeda kya kaisi daaish<br> jab teg ali ki chamkegi&nbsp;<br> sab mitti mei mil jaaegey</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>nazdik takallum hai woh ghadi dekhengey jab yeh ahle nazar<br> kya mufti hafiz maulana sab rashk karegey woh mujhpar<br> mimbar pe kasida zahra ka<br> woh padhne mujhe bulwaaengey</p> 
